  "id": "neural-circuit",
  "term": "neural circuit",
  "definition": "A neural circuit is a connected set of brain regions that work together through their interactions to support a function. In this packet, the term refers to the cortex-limbic network, including areas such as the amygdala, hippocampus, cingulate cortex, and prefrontal cortex, involved in emotion, learning, memory, and regulation of emotional responses.",
